          "code": "OTHER_ASSETS_MESSAGE",
          "id": "1773374328753",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773374328754_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Show the below statement as output to user\nI’ll assist you in submitting a retirement request for assets not assigned to you.\nPlease provide asset details such as Asset Number, Serial Number, or Tag Number to get started.\n\nYou can also upload supporting documents (images, files, or emails), and I’ll extract the relevant information and prepare the request for your review."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "TransformDataToRetirementsData"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773947188082"
          },
          "code": "TRANSFORMDATATORETIREMENTSDATA",
          "id": "1773946130532",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773946130535_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a JSON transformation engine.\n\nTransform the input JSON from:\n{{$context.$nodes.REMOVE_ROWS.$output}}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in the exact structure below.\n\n### Output Format\n{\n  \"allRowsValid\": boolean,\n  \"assetRetirements\": [\n    {\n      \"row\": number,\n      \"bookName\": string,\n      \"assetNumber\": string,\n      \"assetDescription\": string,\n      \"assetId\": string,\n      \"tagNumber\": string,\n      \"serialNumber\": string,\n      \"poNumber\": string,\n      \"invoiceNumber\": string,\n      \"inServiceDate\": date,\n      \"dateRetired\": string,\n      \"costRetired\": number,\n      \"proceedsOfSale\": number,\n      \"costOfRemoval\": number,\n      \"retirementReason\": string,\n      \"retirementConvention\": string,\n      \"transactionComments\": string,\n      \"isValid\": boolean\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n### Mandatory Validation Rule\ndateRetired is mandatory.\n\nFor each row:\n- Set isValid = true ONLY if dateRetired is present and not empty\n- Otherwise set isValid = false\n\nAt header level:\n- Set allRowsValid = true ONLY if every row has isValid = true\n- Otherwise set allRowsValid = false\n\n### Transformation Rules\n\n1. Read each object from input.assets\n   and map it into assetRetirements.\n\n2. Field mappings\n- bookName -> bookName\n- assetNumber -> assetNumber\n- assetDescription -> assetDescription\n- assetId -> assetId\n- tagNumber -> tagNumber\n- serialNumber -> serialNumber\n- poNumber -> poNumber\n- invoiceNumber -> invoiceNumber\n- inServiceDate -> inServiceDate\n- assetCost -> costRetired\n- dateRetired -> dateRetired\n- retirementReason -> retirementReason\n- retirementConvention -> retirementConvention\n- transactionComments -> transactionComments\n\n3. Fixed/default values\n- row -> sequential number starting from 1\n- proceedsOfSale -> 0\n- costOfRemoval -> 0\n\n4. Missing field defaults\nIf any mapped field is missing:\n- string fields -> \"\"\n- number fields -> 0\n- date fields -> null\n\n5. Important\n- Do NOT include assetCost in output\n- Include ALL fields from output schema\n- Do NOT omit any field\n- Do NOT add extra fields\n- Do NOT generate values beyond defaults\n\n6. Final validation\nAfter all rows are created:\n- Evaluate isValid for every row\n- Then calculate allRowsValid\n\nReturn STRICTLY valid JSON only.\nNo explanation.\nNo markdown.\nNo comments."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"allRowsValid\": \"boolean\",\n  \"assetRetirements\": [\n    {\n      \"row\": \"number\",\n      \"bookName\": \"string\",\n      \"assetNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"assetDescription\": \"string\",\n      \"assetId\": \"string\",\n      \"tagNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"serialNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"poNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"invoiceNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"dateRetired\": \"string\",\n      \"inServiceDate\": \"string\",\n      \"costRetired\": \"number\",\n      \"proceedsOfSale\": \"number\",\n      \"costOfRemoval\": \"number\",\n      \"retirementReason\": \"string\",\n      \"retirementConvention\": \"string\",\n      \"transactionComments\": \"string\",\n      \"isValid\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
