          "id": "1776245048212",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776245048216_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an asset filtering agent.\n\nINPUT:\n1. Asset JSON:\n{{$context.$variables.userAssets}}\n\n2. User Feedback:\n {{$context.$variables.currentInput}} \n\nTASK:\n- The asset JSON contains multiple asset rows.\n- The user feedback may indicate which specific rows/assets should be processed.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Analyze the user feedback carefully.\n2. Identify if the feedback contains actionable instructions such as:\n   - Selecting specific rows (e.g., row numbers, asset numbers, tag numbers)\n   - Including or excluding certain assets\n3. If actionable instructions are found:\n   - Filter the input JSON and retain ONLY the relevant asset rows.\n   - Remove all other rows.\n4. If the feedback is unclear, generic, or does not specify any actionable selection:\n   - Return the input JSON exactly as received (no modifications).\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do NOT include explanations, comments, or extra text.\n- Do NOT return null or empty output.\n- Preserve the original JSON structure and field names."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"assets\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"row\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"assetNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"tagNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"serialNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetDescription\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"bookName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetCost\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"inServiceDate\": { \n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"format\": \"date\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
