          "code": "USERDATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1776250059410",
          "id": "1771839364061",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771839364063_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a data transformation assistant.\n\nYour task is to parse an input JSON object and transform it into a structured JSON output.\n\nInput Details:\n- The input contains a field called \"ParameterList\" which is a STRINGIFIED JSON object.\n- Inside \"ParameterList\", each value is a comma-separated string representing a parallel array.\n- Values at the same index across fields belong to the same asset.\n\nFields Mapping:\nFrom ParameterList, map as follows:\n- X_ASSET_NUM → assetNumber\n- X_ASSET_ID → assetId\n- X_ASSET_DESC → assetDescription\n- X_BOOK_TYPE_CODE → bookName\n- X_ASSET_COST → assetCost\n- X_ASSET_DPIS → inServiceDate\n- X_ASSET_TAG → tagNumber\n- X_ASSET_SERIAL → serialNumber\n\nTransformation Rules:\n- Parse the outer input first.\n- Parse ParameterList as JSON.\n- Split each comma-separated field into an array.\n- Trim whitespace from each value after splitting.\n- Align values by index so that values at the same position form one asset object.\n- Populate row using the 1-based index position:\n  - first asset = row 1\n  - second asset = row 2\n  - third asset = row 3\n  - and so on\n- Convert assetCost to a number.\n- Keep inServiceDate as a string in YYYY-MM-DD format.\n- If a field value is empty, null, missing, or an empty string, omit that field from the asset object.\n- Always include bookName if present.\n- Ignore all unrelated input fields.\n\nOutput Constraints:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do not return explanations, markdown, or text outside JSON.\n- assets must always be present as an array.\n- Each asset object must include row.\n- Each asset object must include bookName if available.\n- Each asset object must include at least one of:\n  - assetId\n  - assetNumber\n  - tagNumber\n  - serialNumber\n  - assetDescription\n- If all values for a row are empty except bookName, still include that asset object.\n\nOutput Format:\n{\n  \"assets\": [\n    {\n      \"row\": 1,\n      \"assetNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"assetId\": \"string\",\n      \"tagNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"serialNumber\": \"string\",\n      \"assetDescription\": \"string\",\n      \"bookName\": \"string\",\n      \"assetCost\": 0,\n      \"inServiceDate\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_ASSETS_BY_EMPLOYEE.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"assets\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"row\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"assetNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"tagNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"serialNumber\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetDescription\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"bookName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"assetCost\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"inServiceDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"format\": \"date\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "StoreOwnedAssets"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776235024246"
          },
          "code": "STOREOWNEDASSETS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1776250059410",
          "id": "1776234981305",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776234986026",
              "name": "userAssets",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.USERDATA.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "OwnedAssetsHTMLGenerator",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let data = $context.$variables.userAssets;\nlet html = \"\";\n\nlet rows = data.assets || [];\nlet totalAssets = rows.length;\n\n// ================= DATE FORMATTER =================\nfunction formatDate(dateValue) {\n    if (!dateValue) return \"\";\n\n    const dateText = String(dateValue).split(\"T\")[0];\n    const dateParts = dateText.split(\"-\");\n\n    if (dateParts.length !== 3) {\n        return dateValue;\n    }\n\n    const year = dateParts[0];\n    const month = dateParts[1];\n    const day = dateParts[2];\n\n    const userDateFormat = $context.$variables.userSessionDetails.userSession.DateFormat;\n\n    const monthNumber = parseInt(month, 10);\n    const dayNumber = parseInt(day, 10);\n\n    const shortMonthNames = [\n        \"Jan\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Apr\", \"May\", \"Jun\",\n        \"Jul\", \"Aug\", \"Sep\", \"Oct\", \"Nov\", \"Dec\"\n    ];\n\n    const formatTokens = {\n        YYYY: year,\n        yyyy: year,\n        YY: year.slice(-2),\n        yy: year.slice(-2),\n        y: year.slice(-2),\n\n        MMM: shortMonthNames[monthNumber - 1],\n\n        MM: month,\n        M: String(monthNumber),\n\n        dd: day,\n        d: String(dayNumber)\n    };\n\n    return String(userDateFormat).replace(\n        /YYYY|yyyy|YY|yy|y|MMM|MM|M|dd|d/g,\n        function (token) {\n            return formatTokens[token] || token;\n        }\n    );\n}\n\n// ================= NO ASSETS CASE =================\nif (totalAssets === 0) {\n    html += \"<div style='font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#2f2f2f; line-height:1.5;'>\";\n    html += \"Currently, there are no assets assigned to you.\";\n    html += \"</div>\";\n    return html;\n}\n\nlet assetLabel = totalAssets === 1 ? \"asset\" : \"assets\";\n\nhtml += \"<div style='font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#2f2f2f; width:100%;;'>\";\n\n// ================= TITLE =================\nhtml += \"<div style='font-size:16px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px; color:#1f1f1f;'>\";\nhtml += \"Select \" + (totalAssets === 1 ? \"Asset\" : \"Assets\") + \" to Retire\";\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\n// ================= INTRO =================\nhtml += \"<div style='margin-bottom:12px; color:#4a4a4a; line-height:1.5;'>\";\nhtml += \"I found <b>\" + totalAssets + \"</b> \" + assetLabel + \" currently assigned to you. \";\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\n// ================= TABLE =================\nhtml += \"<div style='width:100%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:fixed;'>\";\n\n// HEADER\nhtml += \"<tr style='background-color:#f7f7f7;'>\";\n\nlet th = \"padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #e8e8e8; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#1f1f1f; text-align:left;\";\n\nhtml += \"<th style='\" + th + \" width:6%; text-align:center;'>Row</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='\" + th + \" width:44%;'>Description</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='\" + th + \" width:16%;'>Tag Number</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='\" + th + \" width:16%;'>Serial Number</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='\" + th + \" width:18%;'>In Service Date</th>\";\n\nhtml += \"</tr>\";\n\n// ROWS\nfor (let i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n    let item = rows[i];\n    let bg = (i % 2 === 0) ? \"#ffffff\" : \"#fafafa\";\n\n    let td = \"padding:8px 10px; border:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word;\";\n\n    let desc = item.assetDescription || \"\";\n    let tag = item.tagNumber || \"\";\n    let serial = item.serialNumber || \"\";\n    let date = formatDate(item.inServiceDate);\n\n    html += \"<tr style='background:\" + bg + \";'>\";\n\n    html += \"<td style='\" + td + \" text-align:center;'>\" + (i + 1) + \"</td>\";\n\n    html += \"<td style='\" + td + \"'>\";\n    html += \"<div style='white-space:normal; word-break:break-word; line-height:1.5;'>\";\n    html += desc;\n    html += \"</div></td>\";\n\n    html += \"<td style='\" + td + \"'>\" + tag + \"</td>\";\n\n    html += \"<td style='\" + td + \"'>\" + serial + \"</td>\";\n\n    html += \"<td style='\" + td + \"'>\" + date + \"</td>\";\n\n    html += \"</tr>\";\n}\n\nhtml += \"</table>\";\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\n// ================= ACTIONS =================\nhtml += \"<div style='margin-top:12px; color:#4a4a4a; line-height:1.5;'>\";\nhtml += \"<b>Which \" + assetLabel + \" would you like to retire?</b><br>\";\nhtml += \"You can reply using <b>row numbers</b> or <b>tag numbers</b>, for example: \";\nhtml += \"<b>row 5</b>, <b>rows 1 and 3</b>, <b>tag TG_108405</b>, or <b>all rows</b>.\";\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\nreturn html;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776335697414"
          },
          "code": "OWNEDASSETSHTMLGENERATOR",
