        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "HTMLForHelpSection",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let retirementHtml = `<div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding-left:12px;\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#111827;\">\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n    Retirement Request Assistant\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#4b5563;\">\n    This assistant allows you to submit fixed asset retirement requests for individual assets or groups of assets under your responsibility. The request is routed to the Retirement Assistant for processing, and status can be monitored throughout the lifecycle until it is posted.\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-weight:600; margin-bottom:4px;\">Before you start</div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    For the best user experience, manually resize the assistant window to full screen.\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-weight:600; margin-bottom:4px;\">How to use this agent</div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    1. Type this command:\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    \"Retire my assets\"\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    I will show you the list of assets assigned to you so you can review them and select the assets you want to retire.\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Examples</div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n    \"select row 1\"\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    \"select asset with tag number [tag number]\"\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    2. After you select the assets, you can provide:\n  </div>\n\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px; color:#374151;\">\n    <li>Retire Date</li>\n    <li>Retirement Reason, optional, from a list of values</li>\n    <li>Comments, optional</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Example</div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    \"update Retire Date to [retire date], Retirement Reason to [retirement reason], comments to [comments]\"\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    3. If there are any validation errors, use this command to view them:\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    \"Show validation details\"\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    4. Once you submit the request, I will send it for approval to Retirement Assistant.\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px; color:#374151;\">\n    5. To check the status of your requests, use this command:\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    \"Show my recent retirement requests\"\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:6px; color:#374151;\">\n    I will display your recent requests along with details such as:\n  </div>\n\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px; color:#374151;\">\n    <li>Request ID</li>\n    <li>Submission Date</li>\n    <li>Asset Details</li>\n    <li>Retirement Date</li>\n    <li>Status, such as Pending Approval or Approved and Posted</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div style=\"font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n    Functionality supported\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:6px; color:#374151;\">\n    This assistant supports:\n  </div>\n\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px; color:#374151;\">\n    <li>Retiring assets that are assigned to you</li>\n    <li>Submitting retirement requests without requiring data access to any asset book because the assistant only raises a request to retire an asset and does not display accounting information</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div style=\"font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n    Functionality not currently supported\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:6px; color:#374151;\">\n    This assistant does not currently support:\n  </div>\n\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px; color:#374151;\">\n    <li>Retiring assets that are not assigned to you</li>\n    <li>Partial cost retirement</li>\n    <li>Unit retirement, source line retirement, or reinstatement</li>\n    <li>Non-English natural language conversations</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <br>&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>`;\n\nreturn retirementHtml;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771840446016"
          },
          "code": "HTMLFORHELPSECTION",
