                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are a JSON extraction engine.\n\nInput API response:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_RETIREMENT_REASON.$output}}\n\nBook name:\n{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_DETAILS_FOR_ROWS.$currentItem}}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Parse ParameterList as JSON because it is a JSON string.\n2. Read X_LOOKUP_CODE_TBL from ParameterList.\n3. Read X_MEANING_TBL from ParameterList.\n4. Split both values using commas.\n5. Trim whitespace.\n6. Pair values by position.\n7. Create lookup objects:\n   {\n     \"lookupCode\": \"...\",\n     \"meaning\": \"...\"\n   }\n8. Ignore all other fields.\n\nSet:\n- bookName = {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_DETAILS_FOR_ROWS.$currentItem}}\n\nReturn exactly one raw JSON object only.\nDo not return an array.\nDo not wrap JSON in quotes.\nDo not escape quotes.\nDo not add markdown.\nDo not add explanations.\n\nReturn format:\n{\n  \"bookName\": \"string\",\n  \"lookups\": [\n    {\n      \"lookupCode\": \"string\",\n      \"meaning\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
                    }
