              "value": "From the input message {{$context.$variables.currentInput}}, determine the userIntent.\n\nReturn ONLY the userIntent value.\n\nMatch case-insensitively and ignore leading/trailing whitespace.\n\nAllowed userIntent values:\n- HELP\n- VALIDATION_MESSAGES\n\nPriority rules:\n\n1) If {{$context.$variables.currentInput}} asks about displaying validation messages, validation details, error messages, field validations, or the allowed retirement reasons / retirement reason options / valid retirement reasons, then return:\n\nVALIDATION_MESSAGES\n\nExamples:\n- validation messages\n- show validation messages\n- what are the allowed retirement reasons\n- valid retirement reasons\n- retirement reason options\n- what reasons are allowed for retirement\n- detailed validations\n\n2) Otherwise return:\n\nHELP"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"userIntent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "routeBasedOnHelp"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "HELP": "add_HELP_1781750250454",
            "VALIDATION_MESSAGES": "1781826452780"
          },
          "code": "ROUTEBASEDONHELP",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1777001002733",
